d was provided/verified by the root agent.","来源核查","2026-10-18","verified","年份","2024","year","list","适用方向","ordered",false,[153,154,92],"dimensions","2D","3D","开发阶段",[158,92],"stages","测试验证","主题",[162,163,164,165,166,167],"tags","neural-simulator","interactive-video","diffusion","Atari","reinforcement-learning","NeurIPS-2024","延伸阅读",[170],{"_54":171,"_26":70},"Code and playable models","项目源码",[174],{"_54":172,"_26":175},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.12399","用途与特点","Visual Details Matter in Atari 研究将扩散模型作为环境，让代理从想象轨迹学习，分析视觉细节对策略的影响。除 Atari 100k 评估外，论文还用录制的 CS:GO 游玩数据训练可交互神经引擎，适合研究模拟、控制与累积预测误差。","detail","资源类型","论文","分类","category","summary","name","paper",[194],[162,163,164,165,166,167],[193,107],[191,192,107],2024,"2d","3d","test",{"_54":171,"_26":70},{"_196":197},"documents",{"_63":198,"_36":199},[201,205,206,207,204,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,203,240,202,241,242,243,244,245,246,247,248,249,250,251,252,253,254,255,256,257,258],[200,201,202,203,204],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-mode